    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i know i should talk to them but they're super hard to get an appointment with and i can't really afford another co-pay right now if it's just something minor. i mean, the jitters are annoying but is it actually dangerous? like, can't i just take a slightly lower dose of the adderall for a few days until my thyroid meds settle in? i just need to know if it's safe or not.",
